{
  "id": "vienna-childhood-friends",
  "title": "同学、院子与第一份秘密",
  "stage": "childhood",
  "ageWindow": {
    "min": 7,
    "max": 12
  },
  "tags": ["childhood", "social", "school", "street"],
  "baseRate": 0.35,
  "conditions": [
    {
      "kind": "placeKind",
      "in": ["home", "school", "street"]
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hidden-book",
      "title": "藏在砖缝里的书",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.25,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 7,
          "max": 12
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 12
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 20,
          "maxAge": 65
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "book-borrowed-and-returned",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}从{teacher}那里借来一本缺了封面的冒险故事书，答应只在课间看。三天后书角被雨淋皱，{subject}用熨斗隔着布把它压平。还书时{teacher}翻了翻，只说下次别带进院子。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "偷偷读完了整本故事书",
              "skill": "literacy"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "reason": "按时还书并承认书角淋了雨"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hidden-book.book-borrowed-and-returned.alt1",
              "key": "book-borrowed-and-returned",
              "text": "{teacher}从讲台抽屉里拿出一本没有封面的书，书脊用线重新缝过。{subject}答应只在课间看。第三天放学下起雨，书角在书包里洇湿。{subject}回家用熨斗隔着旧布压了半晚，还书时把淋湿的那页也指给{teacher}看。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hidden-book.book-borrowed-and-returned.alt2",
              "key": "book-borrowed-and-returned",
              "text": "书在{subject}的书包里藏了三天，课间才敢翻两页。还书那天，{subject}把书角淋皱的事先说了，又把书页一张张抚平。{teacher}翻到最后一页，看了看书脊，说下次别带进院子，书却还是借给了{subject}。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "book-confiscated",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在课堂上把书藏在算术本下面，被{teacher}从桌肚里抽走。{teacher}翻到折角那页，罚{subject}放学后擦一星期黑板，却没把书交给校长，只把它锁进讲台抽屉。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "书被没收并罚擦黑板"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "fear": 0.1,
              "trust": 0.05,
              "reason": "老师没把书交上去，但罚了劳动"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hidden-book.book-confiscated.alt1",
              "key": "book-confiscated",
              "text": "{subject}把书压在算术本底下，只露出书脊。{teacher}走过来，抽走算术本，书也跟着滑出来。折角那页画着一艘帆船。{teacher}合上书，说放学后擦黑板，擦一星期；书被锁进讲台抽屉，没往校长室送。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hidden-book.book-confiscated.alt2",
              "key": "book-confiscated",
              "text": "书页在桌肚里翻动时，{teacher}已经站在旁边。{subject}的手还按在算术本上，书被抽走，书脊在讲台边磕了一声。{teacher}看了一眼折角，说“放学留下”，又拉开抽屉把书放进去。{subject}盯着抽屉缝，整节课没听进去。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cooldownYears": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.courtyard-race",
      "title": "院子里的赛跑赌局",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.3,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": ["home", "street"]
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 12
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 30,
          "maxAge": 70
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "won-the-race-lost-a-button",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}和院子里的孩子绕晒衣绳跑三圈，赌注是两颗玻璃弹珠。{subject}先撞到墙根，赢了，但外套第二颗纽扣崩飞进下水道。{neighbor}从窗口探出头骂了一句，又扔下一根别针。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.05,
              "reason": "赛跑赢了玻璃弹珠"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "reason": "邻居给别针救急"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.courtyard-race.won-the-race-lost-a-button.alt1",
              "key": "won-the-race-lost-a-button",
              "text": "晒衣绳下挂着湿床单，孩子们绕着跑，鞋底把水甩到墙上。{subject}在第三圈超过{neighbor}，手先碰到墙根。两颗玻璃弹珠进了{subject}口袋，外套第二颗纽扣却崩进下水道。{neighbor}从二楼窗口骂了一句，扔下一根别针。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.courtyard-race.won-the-race-lost-a-button.alt2",
              "key": "won-the-race-lost-a-button",
              "text": "{subject}跑到第二圈时鞋带松了，索性踩着鞋后跟跑。最后一圈，{subject}从床单底下钻过去，先拍到墙。{neighbor}喘着气，把两颗弹珠拍进{subject}手心。{subject}低头才发现外套少了一颗扣子；窗口的{neighbor}扔下一根别针，说先别着。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fell-on-wet-stones",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在第二圈踩上晒衣绳滴下的湿石板，膝盖磕破一层皮。{neighbor}端出半盆清水冲伤口，用一块蓝格手帕扎紧，让{subject}坐在台阶上别动。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "膝盖在湿石板上磕破"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "reason": "邻居包扎伤口并暂扣弹珠"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.courtyard-race.fell-on-wet-stones.alt1",
              "key": "fell-on-wet-stones",
              "text": "晒衣绳上的水一滴一滴落在石板上。{subject}跑到第二圈，鞋底一滑，膝盖先着地。{neighbor}从屋里端出半盆清水，蹲下冲掉伤口里的沙，又用手帕扎紧，说今天别跑了。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.courtyard-race.fell-on-wet-stones.alt2",
              "key": "fell-on-wet-stones",
              "text": "{subject}想从床单底下钻过去，脚下一滑，膝盖磕在石板棱上。{neighbor}听见哭声出来，先看了看伤口，又回去端水。手帕扎得很紧，{subject}试着站起来，被{neighbor}按回台阶上。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cooldownYears": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.secret-kiosk",
      "title": "报亭后的秘密画片",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.2,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": ["street", "school"]
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 12
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 25,
          "maxAge": 60
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "traded-for-picture",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在报亭后面和同学交换画片，用一块咬了一半的糖换到一张火车头。{neighbor}是报亭摊主，看见糖纸掉在地上，扣下画片，让{subject}把地扫干净才还。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "画片被摊主扣下"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "fear": 0.05,
              "reason": "扫完地才拿回画片"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.secret-kiosk.traded-for-picture.alt1",
              "key": "traded-for-picture",
              "text": "报亭后面的墙根下，{subject}把咬了一半的糖递过去，换回一张火车头画片。糖纸被风吹到摊主的脚边。{neighbor}弯腰捡起来，把画片从{subject}手里抽走，说先把地扫了。{subject}扫到墙根，{neighbor}才把画片还回来。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.secret-kiosk.traded-for-picture.alt2",
              "key": "traded-for-picture",
              "text": "“就一口。”{subject}把糖块掰开，换了一张火车头。{neighbor}在报亭窗口看着，等糖纸落地，才走出来。画片被扣在柜台上，扫帚递到{subject}手里。{subject}扫完半条后巷，{neighbor}用围裙擦了擦画片，还回来时角上多了一道折痕。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "found-coin-under-rack",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在报亭的明信片架子下面摸到一枚两赫勒硬币，攥着没吭声。{neighbor}正背对着数报纸，{subject}用这枚硬币买了一张画片，找零时{neighbor}多看了一眼，没问。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -0.02,
              "reason": "买画片花掉捡到的硬币"
            },
            {
              "type": "condition",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "reason": "偷偷留下了捡到的钱",
              "condition": "guilty-secret",
              "add": true
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "摊主多看了一眼但没追问"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.secret-kiosk.found-coin-under-rack.alt1",
              "key": "found-coin-under-rack",
              "text": "明信片架子底下有灰，{subject}的手指碰到一枚硬东西，摸出来是两赫勒。{neighbor}背对着柜台数报纸，{subject}把硬币攥在掌心，指给{neighbor}看一张风景画片。找零时{neighbor}的手停了一下，多看了一眼，还是把画片递了过来。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.secret-kiosk.found-coin-under-rack.alt2",
              "key": "found-coin-under-rack",
              "text": "{subject}蹲下系鞋带，看见架子底下有一枚两赫勒。{subject}用鞋尖把它拨出来，攥在手心，站起来时耳朵发热。{neighbor}正低头数报纸，{subject}把硬币放在柜台上，说要那张火车头。找零的铜板掉在掌心，{neighbor}看了{subject}一眼，没说话。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cooldownYears": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hand-in-hand",
      "title": "教室后排的手套",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.25,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": ["school"]
        },
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 8,
          "max": 12
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 8,
          "maxAge": 12
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 20,
          "maxAge": 65
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "glove-left-behind",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}的同桌在课间塞给{subject}一只旧毛线手套，说是从家里多出来的。放学时同桌被家里叫走，手套落在{subject}的课桌抽屉里。{subject}把它带回家，藏进枕头套，谁也没说。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.06,
              "reason": "收到同桌悄悄塞的手套"
            },
            {
              "type": "condition",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "reason": "枕头下藏着一只旧毛线手套",
              "condition": "keeps-small-treasure",
              "add": true
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hand-in-hand.glove-left-behind.alt1",
              "key": "glove-left-behind",
              "text": "课间操回来，同桌把一只毛线手套塞进{subject}的桌肚，说家里多出来的。手套的拇指处补过，线头还没剪干净。放学时同桌被家里人叫走，手套留在抽屉里。{subject}把它带回家，塞进枕头套，晚上伸手摸了好几次。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hand-in-hand.glove-left-behind.alt2",
              "key": "glove-left-behind",
              "text": "手套是灰蓝色的，指尖磨得发亮。同桌在课间把它推到{subject}手边，说自己戴不着。放学后同桌先走了，手套落在抽屉最里面。{subject}把它卷起来塞进衣兜，回家后藏进枕头套，谁问都说没看见。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "teacher-asks",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}在课上传手套，被{teacher}看见。{teacher}课后让{subject}留下来，问手套是谁给的。{subject}说“捡的”，{teacher}没拆穿，但把手套放在讲台上，说没人认领就交给门房。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.06,
              "reason": "撒谎后被老师把手套留在讲台"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "fear": 0.1,
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "老师看出在撒谎但没追究"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hand-in-hand.teacher-asks.alt1",
              "key": "teacher-asks",
              "text": "手套在{subject}和同桌之间传了一下，{teacher}的粉笔停在黑板上。课后{teacher}让{subject}留下，问手套从哪来的。{subject}盯着讲台角，说“捡的”。{teacher}把手套拎起来，放在讲台正中间，说放学到门房问一声。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "vienna-childhood-friends.hand-in-hand.teacher-asks.alt2",
              "key": "teacher-asks",
              "text": "{teacher}转身时，手套正从{subject}的袖口露出一角。课后教室里只剩两个人，{teacher}问了三遍，{subject}都说捡的。{teacher}没再追问，把手套摆在讲台上，说没人认领就交门房。{subject}看着那只灰蓝色的手套，直到上课铃响。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cooldownYears": 2
    }
  ]
}
